# game/script.rpy:36
translate zh_tw day1_c37d1fa5:

    # "Not knowing exactly what you're doing, you are driving your car on a highway without knowing your destination."
    "不太確定你身在何處，正在幹嘛，你正在高速公路上漫無目的地開車。"

# game/script.rpy:42
translate zh_tw day1_e1653933:

    # m "A penny for your thought?"
    m "給你一塊錢告訴我你在想甚麼？"

# game/script.rpy:43
translate zh_tw day1_6c9b63b4:

    # p "Just glad you're here with me."
    p "只是很高興你在這裡。"

# game/script.rpy:44
translate zh_tw day1_3bbdd2d9:

    # m "Me,too."
    m "我也是。"

# game/script.rpy:45
translate zh_tw day1_a48aa051:

    # "You smile at each other."
    "你們對著彼此微笑。"

# game/script.rpy:46
translate zh_tw day1_5dd475b8:

    # "Even without saying anything, there is no awkardness at all."
    "你感覺不到尷尬的氣氛，儘管你們都沒說話。"

# game/script.rpy:47
translate zh_tw day1_614f87e5:

    # "You know this is the happiest you'll ever be."
    "你知道這是你一生最快樂的時候了。"

# game/script.rpy:51
translate zh_tw day1_a5421424:

    # p "fuck!"
    p "幹！"

# game/script.rpy:52
translate zh_tw day1_a9806015:

    # "DAY 1"
    "第一天"

# game/script.rpy:54
translate zh_tw day1_65d7e74b:

    # "You wake up slowly, starting to figure out none of this was real."
    "你緩慢地起床，開始了解剛剛一切都不是真的。"

# game/script.rpy:55
translate zh_tw day1_55afca6b:

    # "What you will sacrifice just to get back to that dream..."
    "你願意犧牲一切只為回到剛剛那場夢裡。"

# game/script.rpy:56
translate zh_tw day1_3864161f:

    # "Reality strikes back, you are just a freshman who is going to college."
    "現實是，你只是位準備要上大學的新生。"

# game/script.rpy:57
translate zh_tw day1_d4aa3508:

    # "You're studying:"
    "你就讀："

# game/script.rpy:68
translate zh_tw day1_59281f4c:

    # "Life doesn't treat you so badly, however you still have your lows."
    "你的人生沒有很糟，儘管有些低潮。"

# game/script.rpy:69
translate zh_tw day1_878d82c9:

    # "You're already 18 years old and you're still born single."
    "你已經18歲了而你依舊還是母胎單身。"

# game/script.rpy:70
translate zh_tw day1_eebb3737:

    # "You are never the cool kids in school, just a shy kid no one really remembers."
    "你從來就不是學校的酷孩子，只是個沒人記得的害羞小孩。"

# game/script.rpy:71
translate zh_tw day1_60a5d52d:

    # "There are many reasons makes you the guy today:"
    "有很多事情造就了現在的你："

# game/script.rpy:72
translate zh_tw day1_81170efc:

    # "Maybe some family drama, friend issues, or even being bullied."
    "可能是一些家庭雜事，朋友問題，甚至是被霸凌。"

# game/script.rpy:73
translate zh_tw day1_3c1868ef:

    # "But none of that really matters anymore."
    "但那一切都對現在來說都不重要。"

# game/script.rpy:74
translate zh_tw day1_370554a8:

    # "You still have good friends around here to support you, until now."
    "你依然還有支持你的朋友們，直到現在。"

# game/script.rpy:75
translate zh_tw day1_1b9419a8:

    # "New college, new environment, also meet new people."
    "新大學，新環境，也等於要認識新的人。"

# game/script.rpy:76
translate zh_tw day1_dcd6107a:

    # "You're excited and nervous at the same time."
    "你既興奮又緊張。"

# game/script.rpy:77
translate zh_tw day1_2bdecf4c:

    # "Since you don't want to screw up but you also know that you're destined to screw up."
    "畢竟你不想搞砸一切，儘管你知道你註定會。"

# game/script.rpy:78
translate zh_tw day1_559fc325:

    # p "(sigh) Guess it's time."
    p "(嘆氣) 時候到了。"

# game/script.rpy:79
translate zh_tw day1_fb0aa25b:

    # "You get freshen up and ready to head to school."
    "你整理好自己後準備出門。"

# game/script.rpy:80
translate zh_tw day1_4955c7d8:

    # "You put on your headphone and choose the music that represent you the most."
    "你戴上耳機，並選了最代表你的音樂播放。"

# game/script.rpy:81
translate zh_tw day1_e1635101:

    # "Your are ready."
    "你準備好了。"

# game/script.rpy:82
translate zh_tw day1_13596cb1:

    # "Perchance?"
    "或許？"

# game/script.rpy:86
translate zh_tw day1_8a8eae27:

    # "Trying to choose the right song for the vibe, you don't notice someone coming to you."
    "當你在挑選適合現在的歌時，你沒有注意到由人朝你靠近。"

# game/script.rpy:87
translate zh_tw day1_78e1f919:

    # q "Excuse me, can you give me a little help?"
    q "不好意思，能請你幫個忙嗎？"

# game/script.rpy:88
translate zh_tw day1_e45f839f:

    # "Noticing someone calling you, you look up and see a girl waving at you."
    "你終於發現有人在叫你，你抬頭看到一個女生正朝你揮手。"

# game/script.rpy:90
translate zh_tw day1_a458cf01:

    # q "Do you know how to get to the bus station?"
    q "你知道怎麼去公車站嗎？"

# game/script.rpy:91
translate zh_tw day1_a9ce384b:

    # "Been living in this place for so long, you sure know where the bus station is."
    "你當然知道在哪，畢竟你住在這地方很久了。"

# game/script.rpy:92
translate zh_tw day1_f1e63527:

    # p "Yeah, just go straight and then when you see a block just turn left, you should see it."
    p "當然。一直往前走看到一個路口左轉後就會出現在妳眼前。"

# game/script.rpy:93
translate zh_tw day1_57804dd0:

    # q "See a block and turn left... Got it! Thank you very much!"
    q "看到路口左轉...知道了，謝拉！"

# game/script.rpy:94
translate zh_tw day1_794429ed:

    # "She thank you and then go straight for the bus station, not giving you the time to say anything."
    "她向你道謝便逕直往巴士站走了，沒給你任何時間說任何話。"

# game/script.rpy:95
translate zh_tw day1_858de7e8:

    # p "No problem..."
    p "沒問題..."

# game/script.rpy:96
translate zh_tw day1_cc48a9a9:

    # "Stupid enough for you to even fantisize something else to happen, you walk faster to college trying to shake off the embrassment."
    "想到自己蠢到還能有甚麼後續，你快步往學校方向前進以甩開剛剛的尷尬。"

# game/script.rpy:99
translate zh_tw day1_b52470fb:

    # "Thanks to your fast walking, you arrive pretty early."
    "而因為你的快步，你很早就到學校了。"

# game/script.rpy:100
translate zh_tw day1_978f6afc:

    # "Which also means you can choose the seat you want in the classroom."
    "這也表示你可以選擇坐哪個位子。"

# game/script.rpy:101
translate zh_tw day1_7ac06c17:

    # "You have tried all kinds of variation."
    "你試過各種地方。"

# game/script.rpy:102
translate zh_tw day1_d90141e4:

    # "Back row seats usually are for the 'players', and the front row seats are for the 'nerds', as for the middle seats, just not so special."
    "後排是給'玩咖'的，前排則是給'書蟲'的，至於中間排則沒什麼特別。"

# game/script.rpy:103
translate zh_tw day1_d5bc1619:

    # "You're bascially the master of seats at this point, and you understand there's no point in overthinking about the seats."
    "你基本上就是位子大師，因此你也了解選甚麼位子根本沒屁用。"

# game/script.rpy:104
translate zh_tw day1_9cb7810f:

    # "So you make your choice and take a seat."
    "所以你隨便選了個位子坐下。"

# game/script.rpy:105
translate zh_tw day1_8a8fc5d8:

    # "Not knowing what to do, you put on your headphone and start to play with your phone."
    "而不知道要幹嘛，你再次戴上你的耳機並開始玩你的手機。"

# game/script.rpy:107
translate zh_tw day1_33a46fdf:

    # "Some time later..."
    "一段時間過後..."

# game/script.rpy:109
translate zh_tw day1_e56c81b3:

    # "You notice that the class is about to start."
    "你注意到課程要開始了。"

# game/script.rpy:110
translate zh_tw day1_1d90c009:

    # "Then you feel someone tapping your shoulder behind."
    "然後你感覺到有人在輕拍你的肩膀。"

# game/script.rpy:111
translate zh_tw day1_80d6a376:

    # q "Hey, glad to meet you again!"
    q "嘿，又見面啦！"

# game/script.rpy:112
translate zh_tw day1_979d99bb:

    # "You look up and realize that she's the girl that was asking for directions earlier."
    "你抬頭看去發現是那位稍早問你公車站在哪的女孩。"

# game/script.rpy:114
translate zh_tw day1_f1202e72:

    # p "Hey! I didn't know you're in the same class, too."
    p "嗨！我不知道你也有修這門課。"

# game/script.rpy:115
translate zh_tw day1_c284b74e:

    # q "Well, who would have known, right? HAHA."
    q "誰會猜得到呢，哈哈！"

# game/script.rpy:116
translate zh_tw day1_f5e2468a:

    # q "I should give you a proper thanks though, I was in a hurry earlier."
    q "我應該跟你好好道謝，我早上的時候有點趕。"

# game/script.rpy:117
translate zh_tw day1_8d839719:

    # p "It's fine, I can tell HAHA."
    p "沒關係，我感覺得出來，哈哈!"

# game/script.rpy:118
translate zh_tw day1_bb4c99c9:

    # a "I'm Elena, you?"
    a "我叫ELena，你呢？"

# game/script.rpy:119
translate zh_tw day1_cad991e2:

    # p "[player_name]."
    p "[player_name]."

# game/script.rpy:120
translate zh_tw day1_01f36b02:

    # "She sits next to you after you finish your sentence."
    "她在你說完這句話的同時坐到你旁邊。"

# game/script.rpy:121
translate zh_tw day1_6f35c6ea:

    # a "Well, [player_name], nice to meet you."
    a "那，[player_name]，很高興認識你！"

# game/script.rpy:124
translate zh_tw day1_673a4ff7:

    # "You listen to the lecture with your full attention, though sometimes you zone out."
    "你非常專注地聆聽課程，儘管有時你還是恍神了。"

# game/script.rpy:125
translate zh_tw day1_b1d4bea0:

    # t "Alright class, before the lecture ends, I want you to know that this lecture will have a group assignment."
    t "好了同學們，在下課之前，這堂課有分組作業。"

# game/script.rpy:126
translate zh_tw day1_50e2de27:

    # t "Since you're all freshmen, I will assign the group myself."
    t "而既然你們都是新生，就由我來分配組別。"

# game/script.rpy:127
translate zh_tw day1_bad6c284:

    # "You're glad you don't have to pretend to be an extrovert and find some teammates."
    "你很慶幸你不用假裝自己很外向地去找組員。"

# game/script.rpy:128
translate zh_tw day1_37bafb79:

    # t "I will divided the groups by seats, you will be paired with student sitting next to you."
    t "我就按照座位分組，你會跟坐在你旁邊的學生一組。"

# game/script.rpy:129
translate zh_tw day1_b7adbc2f:

    # t "You should know who's your parther now, let me know if you have any questions."
    t "你們應該知道組員是誰了，有問題請跟我說。"

# game/script.rpy:130
translate zh_tw day1_b58a0dbc:

    # "You realize that you will be in the same group with Elena."
    "你發現你會跟Elena同一組。"

# game/script.rpy:133
translate zh_tw day1_41ffca22:

    # a "What are the odds!"
    a "看看這巧合！"

# game/script.rpy:134
translate zh_tw day1_a6543c1a:

    # p "Yeah!"
    p "對阿！"

# game/script.rpy:135
translate zh_tw day1_4859b76d:

    # a "We should change contact infromation to discuss the assignment, yeah?"
    a "我們應該交換聯絡方式好討論作業，對吧？"

# game/script.rpy:136
translate zh_tw day1_f7cfb03d:

    # p "Sure!"
    p "當然！"

# game/script.rpy:137
translate zh_tw day1_45e9ce62:

    # "While you type in the contact, Elena talks to you at the same time."
    "Elena在你打字的同時跟你說話。"

# game/script.rpy:138
translate zh_tw day1_32950ad7:

    # a "The universe really want us together, huh?"
    a "這世界真的很想要我們在一起，對吧？"

# game/script.rpy:139
translate zh_tw day1_ee41e3e5:

    # "Overthinking the sentence way too much, you kind of pause for a second."
    "過度思索這句話的涵義，你安靜了幾秒。"

# game/script.rpy:140
translate zh_tw day1_464bbf53:

    # p "Yeah, I guess so HAHA."
    p "我猜是吧，哈哈！"

# game/script.rpy:141
translate zh_tw day1_a2e6adb6:

    # p "(Idiot, get your head together.)"
    p "(白癡，腦袋清醒點。)"

# game/script.rpy:142
translate zh_tw day1_3bb2218e:

    # "Sometimes I wish I was better."
    "有時我真希望我能更好。"

# game/script.rpy:149
translate zh_tw day1_b0550af3:

    # "You return home, thinking this day could have gone worse."
    "回到家，你思考著今天原本可能更糟。"

# game/script.rpy:150
translate zh_tw day1_74c41b4c:

    # "However, it actually went better than you expected."
    "出乎預料之外，今天其實還算不錯。"

# game/script.rpy:151
translate zh_tw day1_b1a15374:

    # "Rethinking what happened today, you lie on the bed to breathe in and out."
    "你躺在床上，吸氣吐氣，回想著今天發生的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:152
translate zh_tw day1_049a8769:

    # "You take out the phone and start looking at [player_name2]'s photos."
    "你拿出手機開始看 [player_name2] 的社群。"

# game/script.rpy:153
translate zh_tw day1_e7bef2e1:

    # "You might have a chance to be with her, but still, none of it happened at all."
    "你也許曾經跟她有機會，但那一切並沒有發生。"

# game/script.rpy:154
translate zh_tw day1_9a16e96a:

    # "Sometimes you think it's the unknown possiblity of that future makes you regret or rethink about it so much."
    "有時你覺得正是因為那個未來有如此多可能，才會讓你一直回想著與她的可能。"

# game/script.rpy:155
translate zh_tw day1_1986f9f3:

    # "You take a shower and chat with your old friends then you get ready to go to bed."
    "你決定去洗個澡，跟老朋友們敘舊完後便去睡覺了。"

# game/script.rpy:156
translate zh_tw day1_4440bf07:

    # p "Sweet dream, I hope."
    p "住我有個好夢，希望。"

# game/script.rpy:161
translate zh_tw day2_f3f2ef46:

    # "DAY 2"
    "第二天"

# game/script.rpy:164
translate zh_tw day2_09b18a96:

    # "Another day, another class."
    "新的一天，新的課程。"

# game/script.rpy:165
translate zh_tw day2_12273f39:

    # "You still arrive class early somehow today."
    "你不知為何地依舊還是早到了。"

# game/script.rpy:166
translate zh_tw day2_15ef7987:

    # "However, this time, you see a girl who's apparently came to school even earlier than you."
    "然而這次，你發現到有位女生比你還早到學校。"

# game/script.rpy:167
translate zh_tw day2_42c13842:

    # "She's sitting in the front row seats."
    "她坐在教室前排。"

# game/script.rpy:168
translate zh_tw day2_9d700e1d:

    # "By first impression, she looks like the type of person that is shy and also a good student who takes class seriously."
    "僅憑第一印象，她看起來像是個害羞的好學生。"

# game/script.rpy:169
translate zh_tw day2_38742998:

    # "Maybe you should get close to her and see what heppens."
    "也許你應該嘗試認識她，看看如何。"

# game/script.rpy:170
translate zh_tw day2_fc6771f5:

    # "Which sound like a weird idea in your head."
    "聽起來是個有點奇怪的想法。"

# game/script.rpy:171
translate zh_tw day2_d999c107:

    # "Trying not to creep her out, you choose the seats behind her."
    "你決定坐在她後面，不想嚇到她。"

# game/script.rpy:172
translate zh_tw day2_19a7ff32:

    # "You try to start a converstation with her, but every time you're ready to talk something just keep pushing you back."
    "你嘗試想要跟她聊天，但每次你準備好時就有甚麼東西阻止了你。"

# game/script.rpy:173
translate zh_tw day2_0e29d6bd:

    # "Eventually, you gave up and start to play with you phone again."
    "最終你放棄了。你決定繼續玩你的手機。"

# game/script.rpy:174
translate zh_tw day2_1b58b35d:

    # "Some times later..."
    "一段時間後..."

# game/script.rpy:176
translate zh_tw day2_3428ae5f:

    # "You listen to the lecture with your full attention, though sometime you might zone out."
    "你非常專注地聆聽課程，儘管有時你還是恍神了"

# game/script.rpy:177
translate zh_tw day2_c2453e96:

    # t "Alright class, before the lecture ends, I want you to know that this lecture will have a group project, and it's due the week after next week."
    t "好了同學們，在下課之前，這堂課有分組報告，並且下下周就截止。"

# game/script.rpy:178
translate zh_tw day2_dc5641a8:

    # t "So you should probably start to discuss your project early."
    t "所以我推薦你們盡早開始討論報告。"

# game/script.rpy:179
translate zh_tw day2_50e2de27:

    # t "Since you're all freshmen, I will assign the group myself."
    t "而既然你們都是新生，就由我來分配組別。"

# game/script.rpy:180
translate zh_tw day2_27a9d335:

    # "You're once glad this class also doesn't force you to find some teammates."
    "你再次慶幸你不用假裝自己很外向地去找組員。"

# game/script.rpy:181
translate zh_tw day2_7c3d7532:

    # t "I will divide the groups by seats, each group have 4 members."
    t "我就按照座位分組，每組一方格4個人。"

# game/script.rpy:182
translate zh_tw day2_027a6529:

    # t "You should know which group you're in now, let me know if you have any questions."
    t "你們應該知道組員是誰了，有問題請跟我說。"

# game/script.rpy:183
translate zh_tw day2_1b89d024:

    # "You realize that you will be in the same group with the girl sitting in front of you."
    "你發現你會跟前面的女生同一組。"

# game/script.rpy:185
translate zh_tw day2_0d92593c:

    # "Since you're all in the same group, you think you should probably take the initative and greet the teammates."
    "既然你們都在同一組，你覺得你應該主動跟組員打招呼。"

# game/script.rpy:186
translate zh_tw day2_2bc49fd9:

    # "You exchange your social accounts and learn each other's names."
    "你們交換了聯絡方式並知道了大家的名字。"

# game/script.rpy:188
translate zh_tw day2_dcb42777:

    # b "My name is Emma, nice to meet you."
    b "我叫Emma，很高興認識你。"

# game/script.rpy:189
translate zh_tw day2_c9d0c61e:

    # p "Nice to meet you too."
    p "我也很高興認識你。"

# game/script.rpy:190
translate zh_tw day2_4b5c562a:

    # p "I'm [player_name]."
    p "我叫 [player_name]。"

# game/script.rpy:191
translate zh_tw day2_cf84b8ad:

    # "You also learn the other's name, which are Chris and Gus, but that's probably not important now, right?"
    "你也知道其他組員的名字，分別是Gus和Chris，但這不重要，對吧？"

# game/script.rpy:196
translate zh_tw day2_e10a73e0:

    # "You get back home."
    "你回到家。"

# game/script.rpy:197
translate zh_tw day2_5a9e1dae:

    # "This day is not that bad."
    "今天還不算糟。"

# game/script.rpy:198
translate zh_tw day2_f1de44a4:

    # "Time for you to get freshen up and go to sleep."
    "是時候該洗洗睡了。"

# game/script.rpy:199
translate zh_tw day2_6a28607b:

